{"id":"wb-6-692","name":"白帝城","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"白帝城","text":"白帝城位于重庆市奉节县瞿塘峡口的长江北岸，位于奉节城东8公里，是长江三峡重要旅游景点。2006年5月25日公布为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。白帝城一面靠山，三面环水背倚高峡，面对瞿塘峡口，气势十分雄伟壮观。从山脚经过高而陡峭的石阶，到达白帝城入口，大门额匾上有郭沫若书写的“白帝城”三个大字，左右一付对联，出自杜甫《夔州歌十绝句》“白帝高为三峡镇，瞿塘险过百牢关”。\n白帝城除去明清的“白帝庙”外，还有石器时代到明清的各个时代遗址。三峡工程建成后，水位被抬高，使白帝城变成四面环水，游船可直达城中。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%99%BD%E5%B8%9D%E5%9F%8E","revisionId":89937949,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89937949","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/7b1dcae794f381f132bb6623.jpg","title":"20250523_Baidi_Miao.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20250523_Baidi_Miao.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7a/20250523_Baidi_Miao.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Yumeto","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Baidi Temple","width":320,"height":240}}